1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,820
It's an incredible experience.

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:04,467
It even changed my life a little.

3
00:00:07,067 --> 00:00:10,433
My name is Juliana, I'm Colombian.

4
00:00:10,433 --> 00:00:13,067
I arrived in August 2025.

5
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:16,633
I started at A2, now I'm at C1.

6
00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:21,417
I wanted to study here, in France,

7
00:00:21,417 --> 00:00:24,217
to continue my studies here.

8
00:00:24,217 --> 00:00:26,233
So I decided to learn French.

9
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:28,750
And I found it's easier

10
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:30,433
and more efficient to do it in France.

11
00:00:30,433 --> 00:00:33,033
We have lots of chances to practice.

12
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,683
Not only in class,

13
00:00:34,683 --> 00:00:38,400
but at the supermarket, at restaurants…

14
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,017
All the teachers are really nice,

15
00:00:43,017 --> 00:00:45,367
and they help us.

16
00:00:45,373 --> 00:00:48,883
It's great, because we always feel

17
00:00:48,883 --> 00:00:52,333
supported, not alone in this experience.

18
00:00:54,533 --> 00:00:57,887
When we played board games,

19
00:00:57,887 --> 00:01:00,967
we really laughed, we had so much fun.

20
00:01:00,967 --> 00:01:02,817
And at the same time, we were learning…

21
00:01:02,817 --> 00:01:05,867
I think it was direct and indirect objects.

22
00:01:05,883 --> 00:01:08,983
It's really fun, we laugh a lot,

23
00:01:08,983 --> 00:01:10,833
but we also learn a lot.

24
00:01:13,033 --> 00:01:16,750
I went to a wine cellar in Lyon,

25
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:19,820
to eat cheese and drink wine.

26
00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:21,300
It was really interesting,

27
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:23,867
we learned the whole process.

28
00:01:23,867 --> 00:01:27,633
It's amazing to see things face to face,

29
00:01:27,633 --> 00:01:30,233
not just online, in a picture.

30
00:01:32,433 --> 00:01:34,633
I like Lyon because it's calm,

31
00:01:34,633 --> 00:01:36,100
but there's a lot to do:

32
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:38,567
museums, restaurants…

33
00:01:38,573 --> 00:01:40,700
So it's really great.

34
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:44,720
It's an incredible experience.

35
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:46,833
It even changed my life a little.

36
00:01:46,850 --> 00:01:49,300
I recommend it, you'll see!
